      "name": "Bridge Financing Explained for Home Sellers — The Second Mortgages | Private Lending With Bob Berri",
      "description": "Timing mismatches between buying and selling properties create one of the most stressful financial gaps homeowners faces. In competitive markets, buyers often secure a new property before the sale of their existing one closes. When those closing dates do not align, bridge financing becomes a practical short-term funding solution.",
